"「動画を拡大」のAI超解像が使うモデルです。SwiftVRとSeedVR2の重みは同梱せず、ここで配布元のApache License 2.0と宣言されていた版をダウンロードします（SHA-256で照合。SwiftVRはこのMac用に変換もします）。Open-H3 再生成は、NVIDIAの結合LoRA（MiniMax H3 Community License）から精緻化の部分をこのMacで取り出して使います。" = "The models the AI methods of “Enlarge video” use. SwiftVR’s and SeedVR2’s weights are not bundled: here they are downloaded pinned to the revision whose publisher declared the Apache License 2.0 (checked by SHA-256; SwiftVR is also converted for this Mac). Open-H3 regeneration takes the refiner part out of NVIDIA’s merged LoRA (MiniMax H3 Community License) on this Mac.";
